    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the main landing gear leg assembly, the torque link clamps, the side stay attachment hardware and the sensor installations, drawn for one leg at the plated sliding tube standard.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the main landing gear leg assembly, the torque link clamps, the side stay attachment hardware and the sensor installations, for one leg.",
      "figure_note": "The leg is shown extended with the doors removed. Item 30 is the lower torque link clamp for the plated sliding tube, which is the only running surface standard in service, and it carries no alternate. The sensor kit at item 50 is fitted to every leg. Left and right legs are handed at the side stay lug and share every other part number."
    },
